    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Welcome to Amato!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a forest spirit able to possess objects and guide kokedamas \u2014 small endangered plant spheres \u2014 to fertile lands! Tilt the environment, master gravity, and protect nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>A blend of puzzles and precision challenges</strong><br>Switch between exploration phases with clever environmental puzzles and skill-based courses where agility and timing are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f<strong>A vibrant, evolving world</strong><br>Use weather effects, physics, and biome-specific mechanics to overcome obstacles and unravel the forest\u2019s mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>A colorful and relaxing atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a cozy universe inspired by traditional Japan, with warm visuals and a smooth, jazzy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f<strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong><br>Easy to pick up, but offering real challenges for players who seek perfect mastery of every course!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/extras/c16eb8d99c552cb79a29741e6dcb1dcd.avif?t=1747071610\" width=742 height=479 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Welcome to Amato!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a forest spirit able to possess objects and guide kokedamas \u2014 small endangered plant spheres \u2014 to fertile lands! Tilt the environment, master gravity, and protect nature!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>A blend of puzzles and precision challenges</strong><br>Switch between exploration phases with clever environmental puzzles and skill-based courses where agility and timing are key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f<strong>A vibrant, evolving world</strong><br>Use weather effects, physics, and biome-specific mechanics to overcome obstacles and unravel the forest\u2019s mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>A colorful and relaxing atmosphere</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a cozy universe inspired by traditional Japan, with warm visuals and a smooth, jazzy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f<strong>Accessible yet demanding gameplay</strong><br>Easy to pick up, but offering real challenges for players who seek perfect mastery of every course!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698590/extras/c16eb8d99c552cb79a29741e6dcb1dcd.avif?t=1747071610\" width=742 height=479 /></span></p>",
